  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-feishu",
      "text": "[中文](#中文) · [English](#english)"
    },
    {
      "section": "中文",
      "text": "把一个或多个飞书机器人直接接入 DeepSeek Harness。安装插件后，在 Harness 的设置页扫码即可逐个创建机器人；每次确认完成并通过连接检查后，都能立即在飞书里与同一个 Harness 智能体连续对话。"
    },
    {
      "section": "主要能力",
      "text": "- 在 Harness「设置 → 插件 → 飞书」内反复扫码添加多个机器人，无需手动复制 App ID 或 App Secret\n- 每个机器人拥有独立凭据、飞书长连接、授权用户、会话映射和消息去重状态\n- 单个机器人断线、重连或移除不会中断其他机器人\n- 扫码用户自动成为首位授权用户，创建后即可私聊机器人\n- 收到消息立即添加处理中 Reaction，成功或失败后更新状态\n- 使用飞书 CardKit 原生流式卡片输出，失败时安全回退为普通文本\n- 每个飞书会话映射到持久的 Harness 会话，支持多轮上下文\n- 默认使用 Harness `standard` 智能体预设，包括网页搜索等工具能力\n- App Secret 仅保存在 DSH Host 的凭据存储中，不进入浏览器、二维码或插件配置文件"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "从 GitHub 一条命令安装：\n\n```bash\nnpx -y github:xmanrui/dsh-feishu install\n```\n\n安装后重启 `dsh web`，打开「设置 → 插件 → 飞书」，点击「添加机器人」，再用飞书扫码确认。需要更多机器人时再次点击「添加机器人」即可；扫码只会新增，不会覆盖现有机器人。页面只有在以下条件全部满足后才把该机器人显示为“已连接”：\n\n1. 飞书应用创建成功；\n2. 凭据已安全保存；\n3. 机器人身份校验成功；\n4. 飞书长连接已建立；\n5. DeepSeek Harness Host 可访问。\n\n连接成功后，在飞书中找到刚创建的机器人并发送消息即可。每个机器人都支持 `/new`、`/status` 和 `/help`。"
    },
    {
      "section": "本地开发",
      "text": "```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/xmanrui/dsh-feishu.git\ncd dsh-feishu\nnpm install\nnpm test\n\n插件运行在 `dsh web` 的 Host 进程内，不需要再维护独立桥接服务。非敏感配置保存在 `$DSH_HOME/integrations/dsh-feishu/`，各机器人的会话状态彼此隔离；每个 App Secret 都由 Harness 的 credential provider 独立管理。\n\n当前按 DeepSeek Harness `0.1.0-rc.6` 的插件与 Connection RPC 接口开发。更新 Harness 后，建议先运行测试并验证设置页、扫码和消息收发闭环。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安全默认值",
      "text": "- RPC 仅允许本机 Harness 页面访问；\n- 浏览器不能提交或读取 App Secret；\n- 默认只接受扫码创建机器人的飞书用户消息；\n- 机器人使用 `standard` 工具集，但不会自动批准 Harness 的高风险操作；\n- 移除某个机器人会只停止它自己的长连接并清除它自己的插件凭据，不影响其他机器人；\n- 重复扫码得到同一个飞书应用时会复用原机器人记录，不会产生重复接入。"
    },
    {
      "section": "旧版独立桥接",
      "text": "仓库仍保留 `src/index.mjs` 与 `.env.example`，用于兼容早期的独立进程部署。新安装优先使用 Harness 插件模式。"
    },
    {
      "section": "许可证",
      "text": "MIT\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "English",
      "text": "Connect one or more Feishu bots directly to DeepSeek Harness. After installing the plugin, you can create bots one by one by scanning a QR code in the Harness settings page. Once registration and connection checks succeed, each bot is immediately ready for continuous conversations with the same Harness agent."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- Add multiple bots by repeatedly scanning QR codes under **Harness → Settings → Plugins → Feishu**, without manually copying an App ID or App Secret\n- Keep separate credentials, Feishu long connections, authorized users, session mappings, and message deduplication state for every bot\n- Reconnect or remove one bot without interrupting any other bot\n- Automatically authorize the user who scans the QR code, so the bot is ready for direct messages immediately after setup\n- Add a processing reaction as soon as a message arrives, then update it when the request succeeds or fails\n- Stream replies through native Feishu CardKit cards, with a safe fallback to plain text\n- Map every Feishu conversation to a persistent Harness session for multi-turn context\n- Use the Harness `standard` agent preset by default, including tools such as web search\n- Store every App Secret only in the DSH Host credential store—never in the browser, QR code, or plugin configuration file"
    },
    {
      "section": "Installation",
      "text": "Install from GitHub with one command:\n\n```bash\nnpx -y github:xmanrui/dsh-feishu install\n```\n\nRestart `dsh web` after installation. Open **Settings → Plugins → Feishu** in Harness, click **Add bot**, and scan the QR code with Feishu. Repeat the same process to add more bots; a new scan never overwrites an existing bot. A bot is shown as **Connected** only after all of the following checks succeed:"
    },
    {
      "section": "Installation",
      "text": "1. The Feishu app has been created;\n2. Its credentials have been stored securely;\n3. The bot identity has been verified;\n4. The Feishu long connection has been established;\n5. The DeepSeek Harness Host is reachable.\n\nOnce connected, find the newly created bot in Feishu and send it a message. Every bot supports `/new`, `/status`, and `/help`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Local development",
      "text": "```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/xmanrui/dsh-feishu.git\ncd dsh-feishu\nnpm install\nnpm test\n\nThe plugin runs inside the `dsh web` Host process, so no standalone bridge service is required. Non-sensitive configuration is stored under `$DSH_HOME/integrations/dsh-feishu/`. Conversation state is isolated for each bot, and every App Secret is managed independently by the Harness credential provider."
    },
    {
      "section": "Local development",
      "text": "The current version targets the plugin and Connection RPC interfaces in DeepSeek Harness `0.1.0-rc.6`. After upgrading Harness, run the tests and verify the settings page, QR-code setup, and end-to-end messaging flow before deploying the update."
    },
    {
      "section": "Secure defaults",
      "text": "- RPC endpoints are accessible only from the local Harness page;\n- The browser can neither submit nor read App Secrets;\n- By default, only the Feishu user who created a bot through QR-code setup is authorized to send it messages;\n- Bots use the `standard` toolset but never auto-approve high-risk Harness operations;\n- Removing a bot stops only its own long connection and deletes only its own plugin credentials;\n- Scanning the same Feishu app again reuses its existing bot record instead of creating a duplicate integration."
    },
    {
      "section": "Legacy standalone bridge",
      "text": "The repository still contains `src/index.mjs` and `.env.example` for compatibility with early standalone deployments. New installations should use the Harness plugin mode."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
  ],
